    "subject": "math",
    "stem": "二次函数y = x² - 4x + 3的顶点坐标是？",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "(2, -1)"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "(-2, -1)"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "(2, 1)"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "(-2, 1)"}
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "y=x²-4x+3=(x-2)²-4+3=(x-2)²-1，顶点坐标为(2,-1)。或用公式：x=-b/(2a)=-(-4)/(2×1)=2，y=4-8+3=-1。",
    "hint": "用配方法或顶点公式x=-b/(2a)求顶点。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 60,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
